# observation groups — a whole (a building's door and wall) inside a family, and thinking on a whole
#
# The market square is ringed by buildings, each a door and a wall seen from the square. Each is
# offered as the building, and together as "the surrounding buildings". The area introduction names
# the buildings; directing attention to them renders them one by one. Thinking about one building
# offers what both its parts afford — here the wall's climb, pinned with `goal`.
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 2 --no-encounters --location-type city --location-id 13453

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180
expect the surrounding buildings

click keyword buildings
choose 1
choose 0
advance 12 180
expect My attention is drawn to a merchant house
expect My attention shifts to a counting house

goal scale_up
click keyword house
choose 0
choose 0
advance 12 180
expect scale the merchant house wall
quit
